        "x": 60,
        "y": 285,
        "width": 475,
        "height": 60,
        "content": "I am writing to express my strong interest in the [Position] role at [Company Name]. With [X] years of experience in [field/industry], I am confident that my skills and passion make me an excellent fit for your team.",
