        "fontFamily": "Arial",
        "color": "#444"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "type": "text",
        "x": 60,
        "y": 360,
        "width": 475,
        "height": 80,
        "content": "In my current role at [Current Company], I have [key achievement 1 \u2014 e.g., led a team of X to deliver Y result]. I also [achievement 2 \u2014 e.g., implemented a system that reduced costs by X%]. These experiences have equipped me with the skills necessary to excel in this role.\n\nI am particularly drawn to [Company Name] because [reason \u2014 e.g., your innovative approach to X]. I share your values of [value 1] and [value 2], and I am eager to contribute to your continued success.",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "fontFamily": "Arial",
        "color": "#444"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "type": "text",
        "x": 60,
        "y": 475,
